# Rendered video deliverables.
#
# These are 15-17MB binaries that are rewritten in full on every recut, so
# versioning them bloats the repo permanently (.git was already 47MB after
# three versions) and makes each push a large binary publication.
#
# The briefs in briefs/ are the versioned deliverable and carry the full EDL,
# so any render can be rebuilt from source. Finished cuts are delivered to the
# team directly rather than committed.
renders/
